#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0205 expect=noViolation domain=SUPPAE
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when the length of a Supplemental Qualifier (SUPP--) dataset name is greater than 8 characters.
#note "Dataset name SUPPAE is 6 characters, within the 8-character limit"
dataset SUPPAE label="Supplemental Qualifiers for AE"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023
---
